sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Med as wc-mediator (observe)
    participant Inv as inventory
    participant Reg as registry
    actor Owner
    actor CISO
    actor Ops as Platform Operator

    Med->>Med: observe attempt: caller or callee unknown
    Med->>Reg: is this identity registered?
    Reg-->>Med: not found (WC-2001)
    alt observe mode
        Med->>Med: ALLOW the call
        Med->>Inv: finding {endpoint, observed surface, timestamps}
    else enforce mode
        Med-->>Med: REFUSE (WC-4001 no contract)
        Med->>Inv: finding raised as incident
    end
    Inv->>Inv: infer owner from workload identity / namespace / repo
    alt owner inferable
        Inv->>Owner: one-command remediation path
        Owner->>Reg: connect register agent|server  (UC-01 / UC-02)
    else owner not inferable
        Inv->>Ops: escalate with network + identity context
    end
    alt endpoint is external and unapproved
        Inv->>CISO: egress incident, regardless of mode
    end
    Inv->>CISO: shadow-estate view ranked by risk
    Note over Inv,CISO: ranked by: external endpoint,<br/>write-capable tools,<br/>sensitive data classes
